<title>USA: Camden Cty, N.J., agency repriced, top yld 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Camden Cty, N.J., agency repriced, top yld 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>EA Moos &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced Camden County Improvement Authority, N.J.'s $12.17 million lease revenue bond issue. The top yield at the repricing was 5.80 percent in 2012.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CAMDEN COUNTY IMPROVEMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>NEW JERSEY</p>
<p>$12.17 MILLION</p>
<p>AMBAC</p>
<p>AAA/AAA (UNDERLYING A-PLUS/SINGLE-A)</p>
<p>DUE 4/1</p>
<p>DATED 9/1/96</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 4/1/1997</p>
<p>CALLABLE: 4/1/2006 @ 102, 08 @ 100.</p>
<p>    4/1	     Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
